# Copy to ios/local.env (ignored by git) and fill in your own values. See docs/BUILDING.md, step 5.

# Your Apple team ID (Xcode > Settings > Accounts > your team). Leave unset to use the team of the first
# "Apple Development" certificate in your keychain.
#BOTW_TEAM=YOURTEAMID

# A bundle ID of your own: bundle IDs are unique across all Apple accounts, so use your name or domain.
#BOTW_BUNDLE_ID=com.yourname.sheikahvision

# Optional: where your game folder (code/ content/ meta/) is, if not ../game next to the repository.
#BOTW_GAME=/path/to/game
